---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="T-Time Series — T-Time Media"
  description="T-Time started in a small room in Austin, Texas, as Dominic talking about his own life. It's becoming a real series — and it's about transgender men and transmasculine people, not just him."
  ogPath="/series"
>
  <Header />

  <!-- ================= SERIES ================= -->
  <section id="about">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Flagship series</h2>
      <p class="page-title">T-Time Series</p>
      <p class="lede">What started in a small room in Austin is becoming a real series.</p>
      <div class="doc">
        <p>T-Time started in a tiny room in Austin, Texas. Dominic was going through life-changing moments, felt misunderstood, and felt like his story had never been told the way he would've told it himself. So he started talking — about dating, traveling, getting sober, moving across the country. No crew, no script, nothing polished. Just him, talking about his life.</p>
        <p>He'd open each one the same way: "T-Time," then into the story. People kept watching. Some of those videos have reached millions of views on Instagram, with thousands of people engaging — and it's still going.</p>
        <p>Now it's turning into something bigger: a real, produced series. And it's not just Dominic's stories — it's about transgender men and transmasculine people more broadly, our lives and our history. That includes men who've medically transitioned and men who haven't, men who "pass" and men who don't, binary and nonbinary transmasculine people alike. T-Time Series isn't defining who counts.</p>

        <div class="figure">
          <span class="big">"I started T-Time because trans men's stories were missing — from mainstream LGBTQ+ conversations, media coverage, even our own community spaces. I wanted to put us at the center: to document our history, amplify our voices, and create a place where trans men can finally see themselves reflected."</span>
          <cite>— Dominic, on why he started T-Time Series</cite>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-accent" href="/be-in-it">Be in it →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
